                                                "sense_id": "bdaf5b85-4992-3b1c-8514-d1c13cb8a53f",
                                                "text": "I read a case study of a woman, Patient M, who suffered from erotomania, or De Clerambault syndrome, in upstate New York in the 1970s. […] One July morning, professional acquaintances and friends of the professor were shocked tor receive wedding invitations to the marriage of him and Patient M."
                                            }
